{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794547717956799002,"compiled_state":{"alias":"bridal-gifted-vampirebat","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"fbd93077de4c38db24c4d0cb6c13ba52180d80d7581c7b55c57d44c58d07cb36","event_uuid":"cb59e4cc-13d7-45f3-8f2a-50edb4add599","position":{"commit_sha":"25e72b8cd4f83893a275e77b0c7f748d77f06b00","position":"1794547675620857001-cb59e4cc-13d7-45f3-8f2a-50edb4add599"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"a1f66f7076eb2b614ca1a53b0c0344536d535e4f800da2cb7ea3376c5bb9b4b0","event_uuid":"f1430eeb-3e1d-40ad-a90b-a5efc5865c3e","position":{"commit_sha":"8d3b66013cc947fb5e4c40100d188c81fe3a8761","position":"1794547717956799001-f1430eeb-3e1d-40ad-a90b-a5efc5865c3e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794547675620857001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"f1430eeb-3e1d-40ad-a90b-a5efc5865c3e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"9794-4336-5ed6-4561"}],"description":"## Problem\nThe agentic plan-review engine (ADR 0123) signs a PASS for a run that read no code. `plan_review/agentic_verdict.py::adapt_findings` sets `coverage.llm_ran = True` and builds the verdict from the findings list alone. Nothing in `agentic.py`, `agentic_verdict.py` or the `agentic_review` step of `llm/workflow/gates/plan-review.yaml` checks how many tool calls the agent made. So an agent that answers `{\"findings\": []}` at once, with 0 `read_file`/`list_directory`/`search_files` calls, gets a non-blocking PASS and a certified plan-review attestation that the claim gate accepts.\n\nThe pipeline engine has no equivalent hole: every routed criterion chunk must return, and missing coverage resolves INDETERMINATE.\n\nThis is a silent-approval path in a gate.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] An agentic run that made 0 tool calls resolves INDETERMINATE through the existing `resolution_class` path and mints no attestation, pinned by a test that counts attestations written.\n- [ ] The agentic verdict's coverage records the tool-call count.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e57f-200d-d402-4a5e","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Agentic plan review signs a PASS with zero tool calls","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cb59e4cc-13d7-45f3-8f2a-50edb4add599","f1430eeb-3e1d-40ad-a90b-a5efc5865c3e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794547717956799002,"uuid":"c18a0982-4a47-4dfa-b2f6-69011354f423"}